    "body": "## Problem\n`deepseek_v3_pretrain_256gpu_gb300_fp8mx_hsdp_config` set `expert_outer_dp_sharding_strategy = \"no_shard\"` while `outer_dp_sharding_strategy = \"optim\"`. Megatron-FSDP v1 applies `outer_dp_sharding_strategy` to expert parameters and ignores the expert field, but v2 honors it, so the recipe trained differently under v1 and v2.\n\n## Changes\n- Set `expert_outer_dp_sharding_strategy = \"optim\"` in the recipe so expert optimizer state is sharded over DP-outer under both v1 and v2.\n- Add a unit test asserting the two outer sharding strategies agree.\n\n## Testing\n- `tests/unit_tests/recipes/test_gb300_ncclep_perf_recipes.py::test_gb300_deepseek_hsdp_shards_expert_optimizer_state_over_dp_outer`\n\nNot run locally after the rebase.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
